targetType":1},{"id":"o2l7F3ugQNly","name":"Enhanced Scurry","aliasedRuleId":"8Ai6vFN7Ut6E","description":"If this model has Scurry, it moves +2\" on Advance and +4\" on Rush/Charge from Scurry (instead of only +1\" and +2\").","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1,"originalName":"Enhanced Agile"},{"id":"QhQL5YYoO3jJ","name":"Enhanced Scurry Aura","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model and its unit get Enhanced Scurry.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"zlKV_VK3wONR","name":"Predator Shooter Aura","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model and its unit get Predator Shooter.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"rqBYj1yANC3J","name":"Unique Hero","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Counts as having Hero, and this model may only be taken once per army.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"jQ4CmTsoXEnt","name":"Defense Debuff","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18\" in line of sight, which gets -1 to Defense rolls once (next time the effect would apply).","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"O2Cd7OibBBA5","name":"No Retreat","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When a unit where most models have this rule fails a Morale Test that causes it to be Shaken or Routed, the test counts as passed instead. Then, roll as many dice as the number of wounds it would take to fully destroy it, and for each result of 1-3 the unit takes one wound, which can't be ignored.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"ZHykLbU6nUWl","name":"Spawn","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Once per game, when this model is activated, you may place a new unit of X fully within 6\" of it. Units placed via Spawn can’t seize or contest objectives on the round they are placed.","hasRating":true,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"eyMkgYDVrP7C","name":"Takedown Strike","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Once per game, when it's this model's turn to strike in melee, it may make X attacks at Quality 2+ with AP(2), Deadly(3), and Takedown.","hasRating":true,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"rH1nxpq0qLmE","name":"Takedown Shot","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Once per game, when this model shoots, it may make X extra attacks against the target at Quality 2+ with AP(2), Deadly(3), and Takedown.","hasRating":true,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"0TfnG5G4JEv0","name":"Anti-Regen","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This weapon ignores Regeneration.","hasRating":null,"coreType":5,"targetType":2},{"id":"QXyt-zV_bjpg","name":"Unstoppable","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This weapon ignores Regeneration, and ignores all negative modifiers which are not from this model's special rules.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":2},{"id":"gVRt_wk8DktW","name":"Hazardous","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Gets AP(4), but on unmodified results of 1 to hit this model takes one wound, or X wounds if this weapon has the Blast(X)/Deadly(X) rule.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":2},{"id":"efmjJPTe0Yzd","name":"Anti-Cover","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This weapon ignores Cover.","hasRating":false,"coreType":5,"targetType":2},{"id":"bjt7_iCtmOK7","name":"Good Shot","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model gets +1 to hit rolls when shooting.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"F_1wfmpAyYwT","name":"Self-Destruct","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"If this model is killed in melee, the attacking unit takes X hits. If this model survives melee, after both sides have finished attacking, it is immediately killed, and the enemy unit takes X hits.","hasRating":true,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"zVconc6Qb-g9","name":"Heavy Impact","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Counts as having Impact(X) with hits that have AP(1).","hasRating":true,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"n8Uql4fyd5AX","name":"Cumbersome","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"May only use Hold or Advance actions, but can’t shoot when moving.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"kQVze0GRY3R9","name":"Agile","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Moves +1\" when using Advance, and +2\" when using Rush/Charge.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"8Ai6vFN7Ut6E","name":"Enhanced Agile","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"If this model has Agile, it moves +2\" on Advance and +4\" on Rush/Charge from Agile (instead of only +1\" and +2\").","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"6mJw5IdqSqNC","name":"Ambush","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"May be set aside before deployment. At the start of any round after the first, may be deployed anywhere over 9” away from enemy units. Players alternate in placing Ambush units, starting with the player that activates next. Units that deploy via Ambush can’t seize or contest objectives on the round they deploy.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"8Ck9GAwUK824","name":"Indirect","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When using Hold actions and shooting, may target enemies that are not in line of sight as if in line of sight, and ignores Cover from Sight Blockers.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"CQes0mDvF4bV","name":"AP","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"AP","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"s6MgSfmgylXU","name":"Defense","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model gets +X to Defense rolls.","hasRating":true,"coreType":5,"targetType":1},{"id":"DhLjIDRrWz6-","name":"Piercing Charge","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model gets AP(+1) on its weapons when charging.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"O_sf2rsHA7rD","name":"Evasive","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Enemies get -1 to hit rolls when attacking units where most models have this rule.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"EgdF_3MSddXR","name":"Melee Evasion","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Enemies get -1 to hit rolls in melee when attacking units where most models have this rule.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"aiYEmCuDPUcM","name":"Predator","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"For each unmodified roll of 6 to hit when attacking, this model may roll +1 attack with that weapon. This rule doesn’t apply to newly generated attacks.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"T08VkBuVmNZ_","name":"Hero","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Heroes with up to Tough(6) may deploy as part of one multi-model unit without another Hero, but must use the unit’s Defense until all other models have been killed. The Hero’s unit, and units within 6” of friendly Heroes with Tough(9) or higher, may use the Hero’s Quality for Morale Tests as long as the Hero isn’t Shaken.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"8Hjy54TYtwb7","name":"Takedown","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model may pick any model in the target unit as its individual target for this weapon's attacks, which is resolved as if it was a unit of [1]. Takedown attacks must be resolved before other weapons.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"_mrPya5SXSqW","name":"Deadly","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Assign each wound to one model, and multiply it by X. Hits from Deadly must be resolved first, and these wounds don’t carry over to other models if the original target is killed.","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"8KujvrTG8k9p","name":"Regeneration","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. On a 5+ it is ignored.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"cU3RtuBXHyq4","name":"Blast","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"If the target is hit all models within 4“ of it are also hit by this weapon.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"62-mYKVM9MLd","name":"Impact","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When charging, before either unit attacks, roll X dice, unless this unit is Fatigued. For each 2+ the target takes 1 hit.","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"IEJp3a4vE0CB","name":"Shred","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"For each unmodified result of 1 to block hits, this weapon deals 1 extra wound.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":2}],"forceOrgErrors":["May not bring any single unit worth more than 35% of total points (350pts)."]}